      "displayName": "✝️🙏PRAYER DOG🐺🥀",
      "anonymous": false,
      "kind": "telegram",
      "text": "Well just got off my bus, and I have news... I met this homeless woman, and I was helping her with her things, and she asked if I was a believer. Then suddenly she starts spitting scripture at me, and her faith is insane, and she was saying something that like when we are bombed by Palestine, thats when the rapture will come. I don't necessarily believe her, but on the off hand, she is some prophet... I am sharing it. It definitely was an experience.",
      "ts": "2026-07-12T22:21:22Z"
    },
    {
      "chatId": -1003502632009,
      "messageId": 4991,
      "userId": 8045440327,
      "displayName": "✝️🙏PRAYER DOG🐺🥀",
      "anonymous": false,
      "kind": "telegram",
      "text": "Ignore my previous message, I just remembered the verse about nobody but the father knowing about the return (facepalm, haha) Thank you for the wisdom God of your word so I wouldn't have my faith led astray)",
      "ts": "2026-07-12T22:23:42Z"
    },
